    "title": "Freeze Watch in Effect for Eastern Iowa Friday into Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Janelle Tucker ,\n17 hours ago Temperatures will take a dip as we head into the weekend. The National Weather Service has issued a Freeze Watch in effect late Friday night through Saturday morning for Delaware, Dubuque, Buchanan, Clayton, Fayette, Jones and Linn counties. Sub-freezing temperatures as low as 30 will be possible. Frost and freeze... Read full article",
